  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Where each status is set",
      "items": [
        "pending: startRun() for every step; confirmStep() sets it again after a decision",
        "awaiting_confirm: advance() before a requiresConfirm or browser submit step",
        "running / succeeded / failed: advance() and executeStep() in src/lib/orchestrator.ts"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Shortcuts in this drawing",
      "items": [
        "Approve and Deny both pass through pending (confirmStep), then advance() runs or skips the step",
        "llm.repair() is not a status: the step stays running while a code step is repaired once (MAX_ATTEMPTS = 2)",
        "failed also covers: browser verdict not ok, probe not blocked, or the run aborting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Run status (RunStatus)",
      "items": [
        "running → awaiting_confirm while any step waits → running again after a decision",
        "succeeded unless any step failed, then failed; an exception aborts the run as failed"
      ]
    }
  ]
